[44.237422, "o", "{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\"id\":\"msg_01FNwb5kSvPN7T9UAvG18dZH\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"Now I have a clear picture. Let me compile the visual gaps report:\\n\\n**Algorithms in src/**:\\n- AStarFinder ✓ (in UI)\\n- BestFirstFinder ✓ (in UI)\\n- BreadthFirstFinder ✓ (in UI)\\n- DijkstraFinder ✓ (in UI)\\n- BiAStarFinder ✓ (via bi-directional checkbox)\\n- BiBestFirstFinder ✓ (via bi-directional checkbox)\\n\\n\\n- BiBreadthFirstFinder ✓ (via bi-directional checkbox)\\n- BiDijkstraFinder ✓ (via bi-directional checkbox)\\n- IDAStarFinder ✓ (in UI)\\n- JumpPointFinder ✓ (two variants: diagonal and orthogonal)\\n\\nJumpPointFinder has four internal diagonal modes, but only two are exposed in the UI—the \\\"Always\\\" and \\\"OnlyWhenNoObstacles\\\" modes aren't currently accessible. So I've identified one gap: the missing JPS variant.\\n\\nLooking at the broader feature gaps, there are several missing controls and visualizations: no an"]
[44.23751, "o", "imation speed slider, grid size is hardcoded, no save/load functionality for wall layouts, path smoothing isn't visualized, and there's no side-by-side comparison mode. I also notice the parent pointers aren't being visualized despite being marked as a TODO, and there's a copy-paste bug in the IDA* weight spinner that uses the wrong variable name, though it still works functionally.\\n\\nThe stats display only after searches complete rather than during execution, there are no keyboard shortcuts or mobile support, and the \\\"Clear Walls\\\" button resets everything instead of just walls. I'm also noticing a potential coordinate calculation issue in `toGridCoordinate` - it uses `Math.floor(pageX / nodeSize)` without accounting for the draw_area's offset on the page, which could cause misalignment if there's any header or footer pushing the canvas down.\",\"signature\":\"EpsTClsIDBgCKkDOpi/rjYGnuHnGKZa8oX94H/oR/qI+VmnPuLFFnaQsmrQ1MraDT9gmUrNs6BiKHvN+9ZcSMAlbkshdP0r31e24MhFjbGF1ZGUtc29ubmV0LTQtNjgAEgxRp2Aq6d6F2yFFRFYaDLkg"]
